    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Country Drive Simulator</i></strong> invites you to explore a vast, fictional open world inspired by both American and European countryside landscapes. Navigate through diverse terrains, from bustling cities to serene rural areas, engaging in realistic driving experiences and logistics operations.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a dynamic open-world driving simulation across 84 km\u00b2 of diverse environments \u2014 from suburban neighborhoods to scenic coastal roads. Build your transport company, deliver cargo, manage your inventory, and operate a wide variety of vehicles, from compact sedans to  trucks. Enjoy the freedom to carve your own path in a vast and reactive world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An 84 km\u00b2 semi-open world map with a mix of urban centers, suburban neighborhoods, rural villages, coastal towns and beaches, farms, logistics and industrial zones, and scenic routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival elements such as hunger, thirsty, stamina, and fatigue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Weather and Day-Night Cycle with Seasons(not visually, for now)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic Driving Physics; Refueling, Repair &amp; Maintenance, ABS, TCS, ESC, Differential Lock, AWD</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse vehicle fleet with operate a variety of vehicles, including sedans, vans, pick-up trucks, SUVs, buses, rigid body trucks, semi-trucks, and specialized logistics vehicles, each with unique handling characteristics.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A basic economy system with your own company.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic cargo transport system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delivery missions with local shops, markets, industries, sea ports, hotels, depots, apartments, suburban houses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interaction with cargo objects; Placeable and Movable, Pick-up &amp; Drop Objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving Parkour with Parking System</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Future Updates and Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Licensed Professional Vehicle Physics System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved cargo transport and mission system. Passenger transport with various jobs like garbage collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New areas for the map, such as airports, new cities and towns, container port terminal, large logistics depots (including interiors), the news industries, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New mechanics include vehicle customisation, a vehicle dirt and wash system, and improved vehicle controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New vehicles; trucks, pick-up trucks, semi-trailers and more\u2026</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced Inventory System with Player\u2019s bag, Vehicles and Storage Depot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade System for Inventory Framework (Shops, NPC\u2019s, Warehouses, Companies)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimization and much more contents</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Country Drive Simulator</i></strong> invites you to explore a vast, fictional open world inspired by both American and European countryside landscapes. Navigate through diverse terrains, from bustling cities to serene rural areas, engaging in realistic driving experiences and logistics operations.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a dynamic open-world driving simulation across 84 km\u00b2 of diverse environments \u2014 from suburban neighborhoods to scenic coastal roads. Build your transport company, deliver cargo, manage your inventory, and operate a wide variety of vehicles, from compact sedans to  trucks. Enjoy the freedom to carve your own path in a vast and reactive world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An 84 km\u00b2 semi-open world map with a mix of urban centers, suburban neighborhoods, rural villages, coastal towns and beaches, farms, logistics and industrial zones, and scenic routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival elements such as hunger, thirsty, stamina, and fatigue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Weather and Day-Night Cycle with Seasons(not visually, for now)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic Driving Physics; Refueling, Repair &amp; Maintenance, ABS, TCS, ESC, Differential Lock, AWD</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse vehicle fleet with operate a variety of vehicles, including sedans, vans, pick-up trucks, SUVs, buses, rigid body trucks, semi-trucks, and specialized logistics vehicles, each with unique handling characteristics.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A basic economy system with your own company.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic cargo transport system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delivery missions with local shops, markets, industries, sea ports, hotels, depots, apartments, suburban houses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interaction with cargo objects; Placeable and Movable, Pick-up &amp; Drop Objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving Parkour with Parking System</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Future Updates and Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Licensed Professional Vehicle Physics System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved cargo transport and mission system. Passenger transport with various jobs like garbage collect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New areas for the map, such as airports, new cities and towns, container port terminal, large logistics depots (including interiors), the news industries, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New mechanics include vehicle customisation, a vehicle dirt and wash system, and improved vehicle controls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New vehicles; trucks, pick-up trucks, semi-trailers and more\u2026</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced Inventory System with Player\u2019s bag, Vehicles and Storage Depot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade System for Inventory Framework (Shops, NPC\u2019s, Warehouses, Companies)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimization and much more contents</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
